ance when \\\\\\\"Enable HTTPS\\\\\\\" toggle is clicked.\\\\n\\\\nRenewals are auto-handled by Lightsail (cron + certbot).\\\\n\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\nE. USER DNS INSTRUCTION SHEET (GoDaddy, non-technical)\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\n1. Sign in to GoDaddy → My Products → Domains → Manage «dunbaroakshoa.com».\\\\n2. Left menu: DNS → Manage Zones.\\\\n3. Under \\\\\\\"Records\\\\\\\" click \\\\\\\"Add\\\\\\\" (or edit existing):\\\\n   • Type: A\\\\n   • Name (Host): @\\\\n   • Value (Points to): «PROD_IP»\\\\n   • TTL: 1 Hour (default OK)\\\\n   → Save.\\\\n4. Click \\\\\\\"Add\\\\\\\" again:\\\\n   • Type: CNAME\\\\n   • Name (Host): www\\\\n   • Value (Points to): @\\\\n   • TTL: 1 Hour\\\\n   → Save.\\\\n5. Wait up to 30 minutes; verify by browsing to http://dunbaroakshoa.com – should show temporary Bitnami page.\\\\n6. Notify us when done so we can enable HTTPS.\\\\n\\\\n(You can ignore any AAAA, TXT, or MX records already present.)\\\\n\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\nF. REMAINING STEPS (unchanged from prior DEP)\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\n• Firewall hardening: allow 80/443 to all, 22 only from admin IP; disable ping.\\\\n• Backups: enable daily auto-snapshots, retain 7 copies (≈$2/mo each instance).\\\\n• CloudWatch Synthetics 5-min canary + SNS alert.\\\\n• Staging → production migration via All-in-One WP Migration plugin.\\\\n• Automatic WP updates + “Limit Login Attempts Reloaded” plugin + disable XML-RPC.\\\\n\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\nG. COST SUMMARY (UNCHANGED)\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\nMonthly Recurring  ≈ $14.50 – $18.00 (see previous table).  \\\\nOne-time domain transfer (optional) ~$9.\\\\n\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\nH. PLACEHOLDERS TO BE SUBSTITUTED POST-CREATION\\\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\\\n«PROD_IP»   – static IP address of do-prod-ip\\\\n«STAGE_IP»  – static IP address of do